{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything about GeckoShop:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>GeckoShop</u> is a Sandbox <strong>Shop Simulator + Creature Collector</strong>, where you manage your own shop, selling all the different varieties of geckos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Your dream of having your own Petshop finally comes true. Get cozy and have a fun time collecting and selling lizards, or grind hard and be the next millionare on this island!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>You'll have to:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with <strong>customers</strong>, set your own Prices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the store clean and working, or get <strong>Employees</strong> to do it for you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the small <strong>open-world city</strong>, with People to interact with, Quests and other things at every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>Shells and ancient Artifacts</strong> on the beach to <strong>fill the museum</strong>, to unlock even more content as you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept <strong>Quests</strong> from various NPCs on the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch <strong>Thieves</strong> trying to steal from your shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate and upgrade your store, <strong>however you want.\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/84e8d96bd41af22c128641fa95b943f2.poster.avif?t=1756109409\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/84e8d96bd41af22c128641fa95b943f2.webm?t=1756109409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect a big variety of different types and rarities of Lizards.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can sell your pets, or turn your Shop <strong>into a zoo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>hundreds of geckos</strong> for you to unlock, in 4 rarities. Through opening chests, mutating geckos in the Lab, Vending machines, and through sidequests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy and open different Boxes</strong>, to get <strong>random Geckos</strong> from that set, and if you're lucky enough you might even find a Super rare gecko.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/4ef220f8ed956b37b0fc92fbd07d4a21.poster.avif?t=1756109409\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/4ef220f8ed956b37b0fc92fbd07d4a21.webm?t=1756109409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade, Decorate and Paint your Shop, however you feel like.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hire <strong>Employees</strong> to assist you to sell pets and products, clean trash from your store, and catch thieves before they can steal anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your shop small or upgrade it to the maximum, make a <strong>giant warehouse</strong> full of rare items and animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Trophies</strong> to display in the Backroom of your Shop, to keep track of your Progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/f3957e775257bc15cb15854f85931fe0.poster.avif?t=1756109409\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/f3957e775257bc15cb15854f85931fe0.webm?t=1756109409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the City, Mutate Geckos, Eat burgers, Repeat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The City is <strong>full of Surprises</strong>! Check out the <strong>Lab</strong>, where &quot;Zippy Joe&quot; made a machine to mutate 5 geckos into another one, and with some luck you might even get a Lab-exclusive gecko (very rare, they sparke in rainbow colors!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the <strong>Wrenchshop</strong>, and talk with &quot;Bolt&quot; about upgrading your shop, or go to the <strong>Paintshop</strong> and let &quot;Doodle&quot; paint your whole Shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get yourself a <strong>Companion</strong> from the <strong>Petshop</strong>, or <strong>race</strong> against other geckos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And dont forget to get a <strong>Burger</strong> from the restaurant next to the <strong>Beach</strong>\u00a0;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sidequests everywhere!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might want to go <strong>treasure hunting,</strong> or collect shells and ancient artifacts to keep the <strong>museum</strong> growing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe you want to <strong>catch fishes</strong> all day long and forget about your customers!<br><strong>Sell your fishes</strong> to &quot;Skipper&quot;, but don't worry, you'll see in your <strong>Collection</strong> which fishes you've already catched, and which ones are missing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/96a0043f52bf0e4edcfb01a82d078864.avif?t=1756109409\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras_big/96a0043f52bf0e4edcfb01a82d078864.avif?t=1756109409 width=800 height=389 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(We are also working on adding Multiple Languages, Full Controller Support, Steam Achievements etc. as soon as possible.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Midas Touch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392420/5860a53c698301c2d62a3f58afc40d31eae2ef9e.jpg"},{"name":"Full Spectrum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392420/9a50079822a050c0072bd83e4253aebff10ca59d.jpg"},{"name":"Mix'n'Match","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392420/57d2d2f1bc5c2965b41f0e78566a0c137eac9920.jpg"},{"name":"Millionaire Club","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392420/169f09afc1f6108ac62d7e1862fae30c70be9aa9.jpg"},{"name":"So much space!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392420/0753bd11ee117bb5c1bec54539a3ea5fc40c03b8.jpg"},{"name":"Gecko Superstar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392420/5a213cb8e22c0ec10c993b53002cc4883bfcd78d.jpg"},{"name":"Set 1 Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392420/d460f26600a53924c15118fee354483f37f792a5.jpg"},{"name":"Set 2 Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392420/c97559082b76d3d19515c629868acb9e6d047ad2.jpg"},{"name":"Set 3 Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392420/9100b37a5f3fe7352901742096a4f615e0ea463d.jpg"},{"name":"Set 4 Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392420/9fc07c48ddca3e6d6a2f42de3d971a9615a7ad12.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3392420?t=1756109409","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756109409","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/cb132212f74fabfc08f6f6f90f78dce2a7c1884e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756109409","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/cb132212f74fabfc08f6f6f90f78dce2a7c1884e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756109409","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything about GeckoShop:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>GeckoShop</u> is a Sandbox <strong>Shop Simulator + Creature Collector</strong>, where you manage your own shop, selling all the different varieties of geckos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Your dream of having your own Petshop finally comes true. Get cozy and have a fun time collecting and selling lizards, or grind hard and be the next millionare on this island!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>You'll have to:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with <strong>customers</strong>, set your own Prices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the store clean and working, or get <strong>Employees</strong> to do it for you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the small <strong>open-world city</strong>, with People to interact with, Quests and other things at every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_pa