rong>, or <strong>race</strong> against other geckos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And dont forget to get a <strong>Burger</strong> from the restaurant next to the <strong>Beach</strong>\u00a0;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sidequests everywhere!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might want to go <strong>treasure hunting,</strong> or collect shells and ancient artifacts to keep the <strong>museum</strong> growing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe you want to <strong>catch fishes</strong> all day long and forget about your customers!<br><strong>Sell your fishes</strong> to &quot;Skipper&quot;, but don't worry, you'll see in your <strong>Collection</strong> which fishes you've already catched, and which ones are missing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/96a0043f52bf0e4edcfb01a82d078864.avif?t=1756109409\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras_big/96a0043f52bf0e4edcfb01a82d078864.avif?t=1756109409 width=800 height=389 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(We are also working on adding Multiple Languages, Full Controller Support, Steam Achievements etc. as soon as possible.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Reptoid"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/header.jpg?t=1756109409","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD Phenom II X4 970<br></li><li><strong>Graphi